    "detailed_description": "After a plane crash, you are the only survivor. You will quickly find out that you are in a remote place, surrounded by unknown creatures.<br>To escape this place you will need to produce an SOS signal, but it will attract the creatures.<br><br>To survive you will need to:<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>- Build a safe place using natural resources such as wood and minerals</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>- Create traps to protect yourself from the creatures</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>- Loot re-spawns after some time, so make sure you make some runs through the map</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>- Find and create guns and weapons</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>- Hunt animals for food and crafting materials</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>- Produce an SOS signal and hold until a rescue point is available</strong></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "After a plane crash, you are the only survivor. You will quickly find out that you are in a remote place, surrounded by unknown creatures.<br>To escape this place you will need to produce an SOS signal, but it will attract the creatures.<br><br>To survive you will need to:<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>- Build a safe place using natural resources such as wood and minerals</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>- Create traps to protect yourself from the creatures</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>- Loot re-spawns after some time, so make sure you make some runs through the map</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>- Find and create guns and weapons</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>- Hunt animals for food and crafting materials</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>- Produce an SOS signal and hold until a rescue point is available</strong></h2>",
    "short_description": "After a plane crash, you are the only survivor. You will quickly find out that you are in a remote place, surrounded by unknown creatures.",
